<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81814" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιορ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mark by boundaries : set a limit</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέχρις οὗ δεῖ ἔχειν</span> . . <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.226d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνευ τοῦ περιορίζοντος</span>
			without <i>any boundary</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				719e
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγεμονία τῷ Ὠκεανῷ περιορισθεῖσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτῳ διαστήματι περιωρίσθω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Salt.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>draw up
				the description of the boundaries of</i> a property, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν χώραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					225.30
				</span></i>
			 (Didyma, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>):—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τῶν περιωρισμένων τόπων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					1231.9
				</span></i>
			(Nicomedia, <span class="entity">iii/iv A. D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>banish</i>, Lat. <i>deportare</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν νήσῳ-ορισθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					76.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				42.3
			</span></i>
            <u>Intr.</u> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dislocate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.Cit.
				1
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			).</div>
